<!-- ============================================================
     AutoPilotDC.UI\AutoPilotDC.UI.csproj
     Faza 8: Adauga <UseWindowsForms>true</UseWindowsForms>
     in <PropertyGroup> (necesar pentru System.Windows.Forms.Cursor.Position)
     ============================================================

MODIFICARE NECESARA in AutoPilotDC.UI.csproj:

Gaseste <PropertyGroup> principal si adauga:

    <UseWindowsForms>true</UseWindowsForms>

Exemplu rezultat final:

<Project Sdk="Microsoft.NET.Sdk">
  <PropertyGroup>
    <OutputType>WinExe</OutputType>
    <TargetFramework>net8.0-windows</TargetFramework>
    <UseWPF>true</UseWPF>
    <UseWindowsForms>true</UseWindowsForms>    <!-- ADAUGAT Faza 8 -->
    <Nullable>enable</Nullable>
    <ImplicitUsings>enable</ImplicitUsings>
  </PropertyGroup>
  ...
</Project>

NOTA: Daca <UseWindowsForms>true</UseWindowsForms> exista deja (din Faza 7),
nu mai este necesar sa il adaugi din nou.
============================================================ -->
